  "title": "What languages does Edge support?",
  "description": "The Edge wallet supports the following languages:\n\nEnglish\nSpanish\nGerman\nJapanese\nPortuguese\nItalian\nRussian\n\nIn order to set the languag...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\">The Edge wallet supports the following languages:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\">English</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Spanish</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">German</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Japanese</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Portuguese</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Italian</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Russian</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">In order to set the language you will need to set your device's language preference in the device's main general settings.</p>",
  "author_id": 9849332,
